A draft with no milestone heading exits 3 and writes nothing: the directory still holds only
the draft afterwards.

-- fixtures/cwd/draft.md --
# Plan

## Context

No milestones yet.
-- cmd --
sh -c 'booping plan split draft.md; s=$?; find . -type f | sort; exit $s'
-- stderr --
error: no milestone heading found in draft.md
-- exit --
3
-- stdout --
./draft.md
